cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite this repository and the study release used for the data snapshot."
title: "GDP–Wage Transmission"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible empirical research repository for studying how economic growth and labour
  productivity transmit into real wages, how quickly that transmission occurs, and whether the
  relationship changes over time. The primary country is Portugal, with cross-country robustness
  analysis. Estimated break dates are searched for rather than assumed, and every published number
  is bound to a source freeze and a specification lock.
type: software
